04. idPattern=urn:V1.* + type → only V1 (idPattern needs a selector, § 5.7.2.4)
===============================================================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: </ngsi-ld/v1/temporal/entities?type=Vehicle&timerel=after&timeAt=2026-04-28T00:00:00Z&idPattern=urn:V1&lastN=1&offsetN=1>;rel="intervalbefore";type="application/json"
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

[
  {
    "id": "urn:V1",
    "speed": [
      {
        "instanceId": "REGEX(.*)",
        "observedAt": "REGEX(.*)",
        "type": "Property",
        "value": 30
      }
    ],
    "type": "Vehicle"
  }
]



05. future-only window → empty result []
========================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: 3

[]



06. format=aggregatedValues WITHOUT aggrMethods → 400 (§ 5.2.6.7.4)
==================================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 209

{
  "detail": "'aggrMethods' is required when the requested format is 'aggregatedValues'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Missing URL Parameter",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
